- IDLE.
- LISTENING.
- PROCESSING.
- SPEAKING.
- INTERRUPTED.
- ERROR.

During TTS playback:
- Stop or suspend microphone capture.
- Prevent the assistant's own voice from becoming a new user request.
- Resume listening only when explicitly permitted by settings.
- Use echo cancellation where supported.
- Clean up media streams and recognition sessions correctly.
- Prevent duplicated recognition callbacks.
- Prevent stale audio sessions from submitting requests.

Preserve existing:
- Read Aloud.
- Instant Stop.
- VolumeX stopped state.
- Barge-in/interruption behavior where supported.
- Speech cancellation.
- Session-token protections.
- Voice response functionality.

Do not regress the existing Read Aloud cancellation hotfix.

